  "notes": "USAGE:\nCommonly displayed on signs at store entrances. Often appears with {準備中|じゅんびちゅう} (preparing/closed) as the opposite side of a reversible sign.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {営業中|えいぎょうちゅう}の{店|みせ}: store that is open\n- {二十四時間|にじゅうよじかん}{営業中|えいぎょうちゅう}: open 24 hours\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {準備中|じゅんびちゅう}: preparing, not yet open\n- {定休日|ていきゅうび}: regular day off\n- {閉店|へいてん}: closing, closed",
